  "goodToKnow": "Die Steuerhinterziehung is tax evasion, a criminal offence; legal tax avoidance is Steuervermeidung. In 2014, Bayern Munich president Uli Hoeneß was sentenced to three and a half years for evading about 28 million euros. A voluntary disclosure (Selbstanzeige) before discovery can avoid punishment. The verb hinterziehen means to evade. Plural: die Steuerhinterziehungen."
